{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s just you and your little sister Rin at home, no one else! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You always tease her because she\u2019s so cute, even though you\u2019re not blood-related! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But right now, Rin is in heat! It seems like she wants you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take responsibility! What are you going to do?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1280p at 60fps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smooth animations using Spine2D technology</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playable in two modes: POV mode and SD mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize Rin-chan\u2019s appearance to your liking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can freely choose hairstyles, hair color, clothes, underwear, etc.!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Supports 3D voice control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">CV: \u5ddd\u4e43\u702c\u7531\u7fbd Yuu Kawanose</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Note:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a discontinued project, but some of the H-scenes (adult scenes) have already been created, so it is still enjoyable. I sincerely apologize for not being able to complete the project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The original title was \u201cPerfect Affection Plan,\u201d but due to content changes, it has been renamed to \u201cDoujin Fever!! Affection!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some features in the game may be outdated or may not work, but the H-scenes work perfectly without those features.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3649370?t=1745144477","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649370/827c13fd7a5dd3d6c39c23b74f593aff889d5366/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745144477","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/